  "abstract": "Speed up LLM token generation with speculative decoding across vLLM, SGLang, TensorRT-LLM, llama.cpp, TensorFold, Ollama and ExLlamaV3. Covers EAGLE-3, MTP, draft models, n-gram, suffix and DFlash with exact per-engine flags, defaults and constraints, method choice, draft-length tuning from acceptance metrics, troubleshooting, and an A/B quality gate with the llm-evals skill. References are split into an engine flag matrix and a methods and tuning guide.",
